PDubgOy1lAsLSjf7kGczcc1uLfs4_DICyw9HAxnkvhA&oe=6AFC8927"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Basket Ball Championship VR", "keywords": ["basketball", "basketballgame", "basketballvr", "VRbasketball"], "long_description": "Basketball Championship VR puts you on the court for an exciting and immersive VR basketball experience! Step into a packed arena, take control of the action, and compete against challenging opponents as you fight your way to championship victory.\n\n\ud83c\udfc0 Immersive VR Basketball\nExperience the game from an engaging first-person perspective. Pass, dribble, shoot, defend, and make important plays while feeling closer to the action.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Intense Team Battles\nWork with your teammates, challenge the opposing team, protect the ball, and fight to gain possession. Every play can change the game.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Master Your Basketball Skills\nImprove your shooting, passing, ball handling, defense, timing, and accuracy. Learn to read the court and make the right decision under pressure.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 Play for the Championship\nCompete in exciting basketball matches and lead your team toward victory. Build your strategy, outplay your opponents, and become the champion.\n\nFeatures\n\n\u2022 Immersive VR basketball gameplay\n\u2022 Competitive team-based matches\n\u2022 Shooting, passing, dribbling & defense\n\u2022 Ball stealing and intense challenges\n\u2022 Realistic basketball arena atmosphere\n\u2022 Fast-paced sports action\n\u2022 Strategic team gameplay\n\u2022 Exciting championship experience\n\nStep onto the court. Make the play. Win the championship.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 Pre-order Basketball Championship VR and get ready for game day!", "short_description": "Pre-order Basketball Championship VR! Step onto the court and experience intense VR basketball action. Take control, attack the defense, steal the ball, make clutch shots, and lead your team to victory in an immersive basketball championship experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vision-edge-studio/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vision Edge Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vision-edge-studio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1345800291930510"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2316204315793180"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1313595124161712"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1578611737256936"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2316204315793180"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794077400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2316204315793180"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1369879859522553", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "1595939752020619", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1345800288597177", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1369879859522553"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "L